  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A single mouthful of pale gold liquid in a stoppered bottle. It moves more slowly than water should, and bubbles that rise in it take most of a minute to reach the top.</p><p><strong>Drink.</strong> As an action, you drink the draught and choose one ability. That ability score increases by 2 for good, and so does its maximum. A creature can gain this benefit only once, and the draught is used up.</p><p><strong>The Years Given.</strong> The draught takes ten years from its drinker's past in payment: not from their age, but from their history. For those ten years nobody remembers them, no record names them, and they themselves recall the time only as a dream. The drinker chooses which ten.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
